Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Fix nested Result in likeSong retry and wrong
 songMapsToPlaylist overload

Both found in review of the sync engine port.

withRetry { YouTube.likeVideo(...) } returned Result<Result<Unit>>, so the
outer onFailure never fired on an API error and the retry never triggered.

songMapsToPlaylist(it.id) bound to the songId overload rather than the
playlistId one, so the returned list was always empty and the guard that
keeps non-editable playlists with local songs in sync was dead code.

